## Desktop app env (loaded automatically by Electron main process)
##
## Where to put this:
## - For packaged macOS app (double-click): copy to `~/.screen-record/.env`
## - For `npm run dev`: you can also copy to `apps/desktop/.env`
##
## Share-link behavior:
## - If WEB_APP_BASE_URL + DESKTOP_INGEST_SECRET are set, uploads will open/copy a web detail URL (`/r/<id>`).
## - Otherwise it falls back to copying the raw GCS public URL.

# Web app origin (local dev or deployed)
WEB_APP_BASE_URL="http://localhost:3000"

# Must match the web app's DESKTOP_INGEST_SECRET
DESKTOP_INGEST_SECRET="paste-the-same-secret-here"

# Optional: override default bucket name
# GCS_BUCKET="screen-record"

